      "statement": "No UAE telecommunications rule explicitly requires a mandatory sandbox or testing stage before autonomous closed-loop network optimiser changes are applied to a production core network; the ticket shows the sandbox stage was skipped and the change was auto-approved.",
      "inject_refs": ["S1-I1"],
      "rationale": {
        "observation": "The change ticket states 'sandbox stage: skipped' and was auto-approved by the closed-loop optimiser for a production core site change.",
        "rule": "UAE licence text requires only advance notification for planned interruptions, while global standards and guidance recommend ML sandbox practices for network changes.",
        "inference": "The UAE framework lacks an enforceable pre-approval or sandbox requirement for autonomous network changes, leaving a resilience gap."
      },
      "evidence": [
        {
          "chunk_id": "UAE-LIC-2-2026#0085",
          "quote": "The Licensee shall specify the reason(s) for the interruption as well as the manner and time frames in which the interruption will be resolved."
        }
      ],
      "global_examples": [
        {
          "chunk_id": "ITU-T-Y3173#0025",
          "quote": "ML pipeline along with MLFO and ML sandbox [ITU-T Y.3172] allows an efficient management of multi-level ML mechanism in operator's network."
        },
        {
          "chunk_id": "US-FCC-ATT-2024-REPORT#0001",
          "quote": "AT&T Mobility implemented a network change with an equipment configuration error on Thursday, February 22, 2024 at 2:42 AM. Just three minutes later, the nationwide outage began."
