    {
      "type": "gap",
      "gap_type": "no_rule",
      "statement": "The retrieved UAE excerpts contain no rule requiring a mandatory sandbox stage or human approval for closed-loop network configuration changes that may affect emergency call routing, even though such changes can isolate a core site.",
